# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI clinical explanation synthesis.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.
# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.
# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"

# =====================================================================
# MEDICAL REFERENCE & DRUG ONTOLOGY CONFIGURATION (STAGE 2 / PHASE 4)
# =====================================================================
# The following APIs are integrated into AI HealthCheck for verified medical reference:
#
# 1. openFDA Drug Label API (U.S. Food & Drug Administration)
#    - Endpoint: https://api.fda.gov/drug/label.json
#    - Public Rate Limit without Key: 240 requests/minute per IP, 1,000 requests/day.
#    - Optional API Key: OPENFDA_API_KEY (boosts limit to 120,000 requests/day).
#    - Acquire free key at: https://open.fda.gov/apis/authentication/
OPENFDA_API_KEY=""

# 2. RxNorm REST API (U.S. National Library of Medicine / NIH)
#    - Endpoint: https://rxnav.nlm.nih.gov/REST/
#    - Authentication: NONE REQUIRED (Public Domain U.S. Government Service).
#    - Terms & Permitted Use: Free for clinical decision support and health IT.
#    - Rate Limit: 20 requests/second fair usage policy.

# 3. DailyMed Structured Product Labeling (SPL) API (NIH / NLM)
#    - Endpoint: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/services/v2/
#    - Authentication: NONE REQUIRED (Public Domain U.S. Government Service).
#    - Rate Limit: Standard NLM automated query etiquette.

# 4. MedlinePlus Connect / Health Topics (NIH / NLM)
#    - Endpoint: https://connect.medlineplus.gov/service
#    - Authentication: NONE REQUIRED (Public Domain).
#    - Provides patient-facing clinical guides aligned to ICD-10 and SNOMED CT.

# 5. Ministry of Health & Family Welfare (MoHFW India) / CDSCO
#    - Emergency Dispatch Hotlines: 112 (National Unified SOS), 108 (Ambulance), 102 (Pregnancy/Infant Transport).
#    - Standard Treatment Guidelines: Indian Pharmacopoeia (IP 2022) & National Health Mission.
